{"id":"57395293cfef9d3f","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-weakly-compact.md","title":"Weakly Compact Cardinal","display":"thm-weakly-compact — Weakly Compact Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-weakly-compact","aliases":["58-thm-weakly-compact","58-thm-tree-property","Weakly Compact Cardinal","Weakly Compact Properties","Tree Property Characterization"],"display":"thm-weakly-compact — Weakly Compact Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-weakly-compact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-weakly-compact</span><span>58-thm-tree-property</span><span>Weakly Compact Cardinal</span><span>Weakly Compact Properties</span><span>Tree Property Characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-weakly-compact — Weakly Compact Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b1542a0cd60ec5a\" href=\"?note=3b1542a0cd60ec5a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md\">../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b1542a0cd60ec5a\" href=\"?note=3b1542a0cd60ec5a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md\">../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every weakly compact cardinal is inaccessible and satisfies the tree property.</li>\n<li>Multiple characterizations: compactness, tree, partition, reflection.</li>\n<li>Equivalent forms include the partition relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa \\rightarrow (\\kappa)^2_2\">\\(\\kappa \\rightarrow (\\kappa)^2_2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Weak compactness is also equivalent to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>-indescribability.</li>\n<li>Below measurable but above Mahlo.</li>\n<li>Applications: model theory, infinitary combinatorics.</li>\n<li>Tree property: &quot;no Suslin-like tree at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>&quot;.</li>\n<li><code>58-thm-tree-property</code> is merged here; it asserted the same weak-compactness-implies-tree-property implication.</li>\n<li>The conclusion now uses the exact predicate exported by the tree-property atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b1542a0cd60ec5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b1542a0cd60ec5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-weakly-compact-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S(\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa \\rightarrow (\\kappa)^2_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1528,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4486","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-weakly-compact.md|58-thm-weakly-compact]]（batch